[{"title":"官居杂咏四绝句 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"左任凭翼舞仙胎，疑是天门折翼来。\n世间或有胡卢血，只倩何人为取裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官居杂咏四绝句 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"黄杨古色老无皮，枝叶犹能荫北墀。\n输与鹪鹩低稳睡，月明清影对公移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官居杂咏四绝句 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"舍北冬蔬新作畦，冬春之交生意迟。\n为嘱儿童须谨护，只愁鹅鸭践伤之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代简寄段德光旧同馆","author":"湛若水","text":"中秘同书忆段郎，江东渭北云苍苍。\n南皋问讯知无恙，老我头颅已尽霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叶生春芳还惠州","author":"湛若水","text":"两峰日日侍我傍，两峰归去天一方。\n心将月逐两峰去，飞云顶坐山中央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑广文軏迁任郴州","author":"湛若水","text":"唐时闻人郑广文，今时广文还郑君。\n他年郴岭烦相候，从我高登南岳云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承邓贲斋以诗报到普惠寺走笔依韵迓之","author":"湛若水","text":"歌声传到拜君嘉，乱坠天花与地花。\n两载相思幽蓟北，犹疑是梦在天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汤中山贰守两子价钦下第南归凤山即席赋寄","author":"湛若水","text":"凤凰山下想高栖，乳凤双双接翅飞。\n目断停云正忆尔，援琴手把五弦挥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"江涛浩浩雷风生，万斛之舟不敢行。\n金焦缥缈在天上，江涛势欲与山平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"九月十二来自扬，焦山之麓访焦光。\n京口归途趍谷口，丹阳取道到华阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"焦山山外临无地，地上人家水上洲。\n人世不闻夫子叹，海怀真见一桴浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"江势滔滔入海争，润城江海汇深清。\n北门锁闼非无地，北固山高铁瓮城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其五","author":"湛若水","text":"石城铁城不可猜，长江东逝打城回。\n若教道德为城郭，天险还应飞不来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其六","author":"湛若水","text":"镇城东西几万家，焦山花映金山花。\n吸江吞海谁胸量，一体乾坤且谩誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其七","author":"湛若水","text":"七里桥南一水通，不知遵曲入无穷。\n野花两岸无人采，我艇中流两岸中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其八","author":"湛若水","text":"恰到溪穷阳步潭，舍舟策马仍之南。\n上方有路能终到，直到茅君炼药庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将由瓜洲往三茅访句曲华阳洞途中绝句十首 其九","author":"湛若水","text":"明道先生此脯龙，佛头光放一齐空。\n我来剪棘披云上，要探骊龙第一宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日泉山","author":"湛若水","text":"九日泉山登翠微，三茅旁望咏风归。\n千寻流上三挥洗，万仞峰头一振衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金坛二尹李潜崖九皋黄门迓予沈渎同登茅山作二绝奉览兼示同游诸生 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"沈渎桥边逢故人，酒船邀我无何滨。\n从前欲说风涛事，风涛风涛难重陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金坛二尹李潜崖九皋黄门迓予沈渎同登茅山作二绝奉览兼示同游诸生 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"风涛风涛难重陈，挥杯只合与论文。\n若为七子忘诗赋，倚杖茅山共看云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"先期史恭甫来同游茅山，家人已迎至镇江矣，月十二日也。意其连夜归报速来，予已到山二日，至望之暮，犹未至，岂为泥雨所阻欤？或赈饥之务未暇欤？未可知也，因作二诗唁之。 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"恭甫铨曹期不来，兴高迹滞今人猜。\n鸣鞭走马通宵报，捷径冲泥冒雨回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"先期史恭甫来同游茅山家人已迎至镇江矣月十二日也意其连夜归报速来予已到山二日至望之暮犹未至岂为泥雨所阻欤或赈饥之务未暇欤未可知也因作二诗唁之 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"尽道知山有子贤，恤邻焚券是光先。\n邑人救火牵行计，散谷分煤岁十千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祁门汪茂才可立久住九华来寿予以太极章答之","author":"湛若水","text":"爱尔九华来秀色，寿予太极之长篇。\n九华看到同根处，太极中峰坐九年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安访吟风弄月台诸胜奉陈太守 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"金鏊阁上看山来，为仰前修陟古台。\n弄月吟风乃何意？\n芙蓉自对桂花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安访吟风弄月台诸胜奉陈太守 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"台高吟弄连君子，铁汉楼堪对墨君。\n宇宙无穷今古事，人情类聚又群分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安访吟风弄月台诸胜奉陈太守 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"君子堂开邓子题，君子去后遗人思。\n后来居守者谁子？\n太丘恺悌吾无疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘秋卿梅国书院 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"山绕孤城城带溪，幽居溪畔与城西。\n主翁独擅溪山胜，消得泉翁来杖藜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘秋卿梅国书院","author":"湛若水","text":"楼外堂前沼引溪，楼中充栋青云齐。\n半年恭默开群藉，学礼无穷但学诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访刘秋卿梅国书院 其三","author":"湛若水","text":"书院初成桃李树，即看桃李渐成蹊。\n背山莫讶刘因僻，起舞还应听晓鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观蔡九逵北游图卷","author":"湛若水","text":"●屋山人北学时，青春眉宇青云姿。\n而今翰苑披图看，四十年光画里移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其一 大胜关","author":"湛若水","text":"驻桨燃灯大胜关，此关人道是天关。\n胜心已化江流远，超出人间第一关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈母山","author":"湛若水","text":"慈母山前江水流，春来秋去几时休？\n不知大舜终身慕，也见丁兰刻母不？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石","author":"湛若水","text":"谪仙捉月骑鲸去，胜迹空馀采石楼。\n登楼望月月不见，老拳搥碎此楼休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖","author":"湛若水","text":"吉祥寺前路转迂，毗卢閤上坐虚无。\n淊淊不尽芜湖水，曾阅人间几丈夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜陵","author":"湛若水","text":"铜岭峰头驾铁船，望中神爽一飘然。\n少间复作千年慨，慨底如吾济巨川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述九华","author":"湛若水","text":"曾见阳明说九华，千重山锁万重霞。\n中严觅得幽人宅，中夜无言自月斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望九华","author":"湛若水","text":"多年梦与九华通，到眼山山似梦中。\n已见九华同面目，九华疑与此心同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其二 将入九华","author":"湛若水","text":"九山翠色入云齐，一角青天为尔低。\n即欲拨云问天路，云深天路恐无蹊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐山","author":"湛若水","text":"见说齐山九华根，此根合是无穷门。\n若非万嶂千峰拱，未见华山是极尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其三 化城寺","author":"湛若水","text":"山绕如城是化城，城中佛子但知耕。\n高低心地田塍在，未许町畦起妄争。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其四 访阳明书院","author":"湛若水","text":"不见高人新建公，旧游脚迹己成空。\n当时吟弄人何在，明月清风只自同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登金地藏塔","author":"湛若水","text":"地藏峰头咏五钗，阳明去后我升阶。\n到来阶级无多在，拄杖飞空无伴侪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其五 无相寺心期亭","author":"湛若水","text":"无相心期期亦无，此心直与天为徒。\n从前欲问天何似，无相参前即是吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙池","author":"湛若水","text":"神龙卧处池水清，龙池水涸龙不兴。\n上天若欲作雷雨，泽世舍子其谁能？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿无相寺心期亭","author":"湛若水","text":"无相中间真相在，有期前路是真期。\n有无并作中霄梦，似到羲黄穆穆时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游齐山 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"华山者了又齐山，始悟山山与性关。\n山水若无关涉处，如何山水得怡颜？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游齐山 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"已度仙桥窥石鼓，上清还在上方头。\n今霄知有来朝否？\n胜景应须秉烛游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清溪 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"会华堂起湛公来，多谢明公大手裁。\n若谓相公墩岂敢，相公瑞为后贤开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其六","author":"湛若水","text":"失心失路可哀人，忽悟翻哀在自身。\n痛痒自身自知得，何如鸡犬又乡邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其七","author":"湛若水","text":"湛然坐到廓然时，不着纤毫看一丝。\n谁今未识虚明体，更拜延平一问之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清溪 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"不记他乡何处乡，湛然亭在水中央。\n蓬湾九曲江流绕，似我思子九回肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过清溪 其五","author":"湛若水","text":"今人游处古人游，万古清溪只自流。\n溪月曾经照太白，太白不见令人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书所见","author":"湛若水","text":"急江崩岸群鹅浴，更有群牛来饮之。\n著足忘机方趾地，不应人自不能知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李阳江心将至安庆","author":"湛若水","text":"李阳河北庆阳城，船到江心水逆行。\n船头波浪舂天起，船底风雷动地生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其八 从石太守熊同府饮大观亭","author":"湛若水","text":"快目明眸坐大观，我观大块目无全。\n有时化作鸿毛洒，又化鸿蒙未判前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其九 姑山","author":"湛若水","text":"时人唤尔小姑山，吾作中流砥柱看。\n何物女儿能此健，山头只欠丈夫冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其十","author":"湛若水","text":"人道先生是逸民，不知二姓即无君。\n当时若作杨朱学，彭泽如何来屈身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长江杂咏十一首 其十一 彭泽谒靖节先生祠","author":"湛若水","text":"彭泽如何是屈身，折腰不为督邮人。\n区区刘宋皆邮吏，松雪茆庐恨未论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿湖口","author":"湛若水","text":"停舟楚尾与吴头，二水滔滔争乱流。\n却似当年争战地，至今遗怒未曾休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大姑鞋山","author":"湛若水","text":"两姑皆是中流柱，铁作肝肠石化身。\n大姑不知何处去？\n独遗只履示凡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨郡博周君迁河阴掌教","author":"湛若水","text":"河阴白日书一幅，北风吹到江东曲。\n独怜区区羁病身，不得送子甘泉麓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访庐山白鹿洞 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"卅年不见庐山面，依旧庐山似我●。\n驻桨题诗人不见，丹山今在小司徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访庐山白鹿洞 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"山青云白似吾无，似笑头颅非故吾。\n世态日随人事变，山灵何必讶头颅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26706,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访庐山白鹿洞 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"如何瀑布不飞津，秋后山枯山亦贫。\n纵有真龙能作雨，真龙亦自解全身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26707,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访庐山白鹿洞 其四","author":"湛若水","text":"甲子题诗入洞扃，山灵于我得无情。\n北风浩浩吹云幕，五老欣欣举手迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26708,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访庐山白鹿洞 其二","author":"湛若水","text":"朱陆当年此讲闻，晓然义利一时分。\n要知义利真消息，物我心生胜火焚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":26709,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过十八滩戏作 其一","author":"湛若水","text":"乱石堆江谁主张，因思滟滪可怜伤。\n倚蓬不语细思量，好与人家砌屋墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv